LOG: MEMDUMP [seg]:[off] [len] [filename] - Write memory to a text file (default: MEMDUMP.TXT).
LOG: MEMDUMPBIN [s]:[o] [len] [filename]  - Write memory to a binary file (default: MEMDUMP.BIN).
LOG: MEMFIND [seg]:[off] [.].. - Start memory find search instance.
