LOG: SELINFO [segName]         - Show selector info.
LOG: INTVEC [filename]         - Writes interrupt vector table to file.
LOG: INTHAND [intNum]          - Set code view to interrupt handler.
LOG: MMX [=t] [reg]            - Display MMX register file (t can be B,W,D,Q)
LOG: MMX [=t] [reg] SET [val]  - Set MMX register (t can be B,W,D,Q), val is comma-separated
LOG: SSE [=t] [reg]            - Display SSE register file (t can be B,W,D,Q,X,S,F)
